 * {{Code|viper_nethertoxin}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Aura}}
** [[File:Dota2 Cast Range to AoE Visualization icon-2-1.png|84px]][[File:Dota2 Cast Range to AoE Visualization icon-2-2.png|84px]]
*** Creates an [[aura]] at the {{Symbol|Target|AreaAlt}} area-targeted location upon cast.
*** Can affect enemy units at max {{Symbol|bonus cas}} {{Symbol|bonus aoe}} {{#expr:{{#var:Nethertoxin cast range}}+{{#var:Nethertoxin value1}}}}-distance away with the [[cast range]] and [[effect radius]].
*** Applies a flat {{M|attack speed}} slow within the radius over the entire duration.
** {{Symbol|a|Up}}
*** Other ability components applied from the aura are independent of each other and have the following properties:
**** The applied instance value resets whenever the affected unit leaves the radius.
**** Applied in {{#var:Nethertoxin value2}}-second intervals, starting {{#var:Nethertoxin value2}} upon the either the buff or debuff application, over {{calc|(v1+{{#var:Nethertoxin type1 value3}})/{{#var:Nethertoxin value2}}|v1={{#var:Nethertoxin type1 value2}}}} instances for the entire duration, and is defined as:
***** {{cf|expr}}
****** {{Code|Value<sub>n</sub> {{=}} MIN InstValue + ( n - 1 ) × ( (MAX - MIN)InstValue / {{#var:Nethertoxin basic1}} x {{#var:Nethertoxin value2}} ) , when n ≤ {{#expr:{{#var:Nethertoxin basic1}}/{{#var:Nethertoxin value2}}}}}}
****** {{Code|Value<sub>n</sub> {{=}} MAX InstValue , when n ≥ {{#expr:{{#var:Nethertoxin basic1}}/{{#var:Nethertoxin value2}}+1}}}}
**** In short, the following ability values '''start from their min values''', reach their '''max values at the {{#var:Nethertoxin value5}}<sup>th</sup> instance''', and continue applying their max values for their remaining durations:
***** {{Symbol|Affect|Self}} {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}}
****** {{cf|aghnotes}} Grants {{calc|v1*1|v1={{#var:Nethertoxin expr3}}|%}} {{M|magic resistance}} bonus per Nethertoxin interval within the radius.
***** {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}} {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}}
****** The {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}} component.
******* Increases by {{#var:Nethertoxin expr1}} damage per Nethertoxin interval within the radius.
******** Both leveling up the ability and learning the {{ValueColor||damage increasing|15tal}} {{M|talent|t=t2r}} do not update the current damage values.
******** However, if the debuff is applied after leveling the ability or learning the talent, the ability applies the updated damage values on the debuff-affected enemy.
**** {{cf|talnotes}} The {{ValueColor||area-of-effect incremental increase|25tal}} {{M|talent|t=t4r}} increases linearly up until {{ValueColor||{{#expr:{{#var:Nethertoxin value1}}+{{#var:Nethertoxin type2 value1}}*{{#explode:{{#var:Nethertoxin type1 value2}}|/|3}}/{{#var:Nethertoxin value2}}}}|25tal}} radius.

* {{Symbol|Target|Area-Inter}}
** Multiple overlapping Nethertoxin radii do not stack.

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Nethertoxin icon0}}
| desc = Viper releases a Nethertoxin at the targeted area. Units in that area take an increasing damage over time based on how long they remain in it. Units in it have their attack speed slowed.
}}
* {{Symbol|Projectile|base}}
** Has {{#var:Nethertoxin basic2}}-{{M|projectile speed}}.

<!--* Deals {{calc|(v1-v2)/{{#var:Nethertoxin basic1}}*{{#var:Nethertoxin value2}} round2|v1={{#var:Nethertoxin value4}}|v2={{#var:Nethertoxin value3}}}}

* math = sum arithmetic seq + fixed dmg per interval S_n = n/2 [ 2 a + ( n − 1 ) d ]-->

