**#** The {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}} per interval increment component.
**#** The [[aura]]-based flat {{M|attack speed}} slow.
**#** {{Symbol|fx|v}}
**#*** The ability's effect applied to enemy units at the landing radious is visible to everyone, including the following units:
