**# Applies {{A|Viper|Corrosive Skin}} of its corresponding level within the radius:
**#* The {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}} per second component.
**#* The {{M|attack speed}} {{M|debuff}}.
**# {{Symbol|Trees}}
**#* [[Trees]] within 100 radius are destroyed upon landing.

 {{Gamedesc
