** {{A|Viper|Nethertoxin}}
** {{A|Viper|Corrosive Skin}}

* {{Symbol|Affect|Self}} {{Symbol|fx|v}}
** Upon cast, Viper ascends 100-distance on the z-axis, then dives to the ground at {{#var:Nosedive basic1}}-speed over 0.1 seconds.

