 * {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|viper_viper_strike_slow}}
** Deals {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}} in 1-second intervals, starting immediately upon debuff application, over {{#var:Viper Strike value5}} ({{Symbol|bonus t1r}} {{ValueColor|| {{#var:Viper Strike value5 tal}}|10tal}}) damage instances.
** The following values applied reduce incrementally per {{M|server tick}}, over {{#expr:trunc({{#var:Viper Strike value5}}/{{G|tick rate}})}} instances.
*** {{Symbol|a|down}}
**** Reduces the total {{M|movement speed}} slow by {{calc|v1*{{G|tick rate}} round3|v1={{#var:Viper Strike value2}}|%}} per interval.
**** Reduces the total {{M|attack speed}} slow by {{calc|v1*{{G|tick rate}} round2|v1={{#var:Viper Strike value3}}|}} per interval.
** Reapplying the debuff refreshes its duration, but neither updates the ability values, nor affects the damage intervals.

* Affects the following units:
** {{M|Couriers}}

